OL,3,GNEWSAThieves steal six-figure haul
OL,4,Aduring eight break-ins
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves have made off with a haul worth
OL,7,Fa six-figure sum in a spate of
OL,8,Fbreak-ins in the south of Scotland.
OL,10,FEight properties were broken into in
OL,11,Fthe Lockerbie, Dalton and Lochmaben
OL,12,Fareas between Friday evening and the
OL,13,Fearly hours of Saturday.
OL,15,FPolice said three vehicles were stolen,
OL,16,Falong with two quad bikes, a cattle
OL,17,Ftrailer, power tools and fuel.
OL,19,FOfficers have been checking any
OL,20,Frelevant CCTV footage from the area in
OL,21,Fthe bid to trace the thieves.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
